{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Round 6 closeout. Q1 (approved a+b): ticket regional-lamproite-flee created; two revision rounds absorbed gate findings (read-set must live in the SIGNED manifest; integrate with ADR-0002's content-hash machinery rather than a parallel trigger; concrete blast-radius paths) — still open with 4 remaining implementation-level findings (read-set normalization protocol, glob→concrete-path expansion for the ADR-0002 seam) for the implementing session. Q2: ticket brickred-hapless-dromedary (attach-commits on CLI+lib+MCP with validation in the shared seam, docs, and the DET file-impact-vs-diff close check with owned exemption globs and defined path semantics; CV-diff use explicitly out of scope per operator) — open with 1 remaining finding on the referencing-scan's descendant scope. Q3: material_parts decomposition shows 98% of revised-material re-review pairs moved the plan text (deps-only moves are rare), so the 37%-new-criteria audit stands; but same-fp flips are genuine flap, so any cited-anchor pre-check must warn/decline-with---force (mirroring BLOCK-verdict-reuse), never hard-block. Q4: root cause found and ticketed — overlap has surfaced 0 findings ever because (1) batch-path verdicts carry confidence=0.0 (live-probed: even a blatant near-duplicate judges abstain/0.0 with no exception), below the 0.7 conjunction bar, likely fatal since batching (c403); (2) since 7fa8102477 the flat 1024 output cap truncates real batches → whole-batch abstains. Repair bug cumbersome-littlish-koalabear PASSED plan-review and is signed/claimable (fix confidence contract + scale output budget from _CANDIDATES_PER_CALL + live calibration case). Cumulative experiment spend ≈ $124/$150."},"env_id":"b8a354e0